Package: EdgeCount
Type: Package
Title: Edge-Count Statistics
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
  person(
      "J.R.", "Pradines",
      email = "joelrmath@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Description: Estimates edge-count based statistics in large and sparse graphs. The underlying model is a Random Graph with Given Expected Degrees (RGGED). Functionality includes estimating connectedness within or between vertex sets, calculating associated p-values and other statistics, and performing enrichment analysis based on bipartite graphs of terms and their elements. Functions are optimized for time complexity.
